WEBVTT

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:07.144
Welcome to The Motoring Central. Everything your car needs, in one place. Here's a quick tour.

00:00:07.944 --> 00:00:15.116
Start on the front page. Type what you need in your own words, or tap one of the quick buttons, like MOT, valet, or broken down.

00:00:15.916 --> 00:00:24.270
You can book an MOT at a test station near you, a full valet at your door, bodywork and alloy wheel repairs, or an auto electrician or locksmith.

00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:32.163
If you've broken down, or your electric car is out of charge, tell us where you are. You'll see who can come, how soon, and the full price.

00:00:32.963 --> 00:00:37.761
Learning to drive? Choose your instructor, pick a lesson time that suits you, and book online.

00:00:38.561 --> 00:00:48.560
Every booking follows the same simple steps. Enter your registration, so we know your exact car, then compare checked local partners near you, and choose the one you want.

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:53.134
You see the full price before you book, and you pay securely online.

00:00:53.934 --> 00:01:02.509
Looking for your next car or van? Search by make, price and mileage, and message the dealer directly. You can compare RAC breakdown cover too.

00:01:03.309 --> 00:01:12.620
Your bookings, your quotes and your messages are all in one place, in My account. And if you need a hand, you can message our team, because you're always dealing with real people.

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:18.494
The Motoring Central. Buy, fix, clean, rescue. Type what you need, and let's get started.
